WEBVTT

00:06.640 --> 00:09.800
Minister Tang what should we do now?

00:09.880 --> 00:14.400
Yes, yes Your Majesty Chu Meng is incompetent.

00:14.800 --> 00:18.320
He spent months and still hasn't managed the Beishuo Army.

00:18.400 --> 00:22.000
The soldiers in the army simply don't obey his orders so that.

00:22.160 --> 00:26.800
In battles with the rebels, we've suffered repeated defeats Your servant requests Chu Meng's execution.

00:28.720 --> 00:34.400
Your Majesty's safety is paramount why not leave the city temporarily incompetent what should we do?

